Error [jet.ErrorConversionCycle]: Error conversion cycle: `impl SourceErr.From(TargetErr)` would make conversion loop
  --> tests/ui/e2418_error_conv_cycle.jet:6:16
    |
  6 | impl SourceErr.From(TargetErr) { from: fn(error: TargetErr) -> SourceErr { SourceErr.One } }
    |                ^^^^
 Why: Error conversions must form an acyclic route so a failure has one finite meaning.
 Fix: Remove this edge or choose a target that is not already reachable back to the source.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2418
